ser":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T06:46:27Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T06:46:27Z","body":"> Notifications only work when the application is properly exported/bundled\r\n\r\nThis is fully expected, bundled app is the only supported way to run it on macOS.\r\n\r\n> Notifications will only appear if application is out of focus. Needs investigating.\r\n\r\nLikely require notification center delegate (interface can be added to `GodotApplicationDelegate`) and handlig of this:\r\n- [userNotificationCenter:shouldPresentNotification:](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/foundation/nsusernotificationcenterdelegate/1409032-usernotificationcenter?language=objc)\r\n- [userNotificationCenter:willPresentNotification:withCompletionHandler:](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications/unusernotificationcenterdelegate/usernotificationcenter(_:willpresent:withcompletionhandler:)?language=objc)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2782191906/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2795482337","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104980#issuecomment-2795482337","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104980","id":2795482337,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mn6zh","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-11T00:23:23Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T00:23:56Z","body":"> This is fully expected, bundled app is the only supported way to run it on macOS.\r\n\r\nIs it possible to symlink a binary to the macOS template bundle folder's as `Contents/MacOS/Godot`? This way, you can keep recompiling without `generate_bundle=yes` and it will run as bundled if you run the binary at the symlinked location.\r\n\r\nIf not, we should probably print a warning at the beginning of an editor build when `generate_bundle=yes` is not being used.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2795482337/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2807626203","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104980#issuecomment-2807626203","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104980","id":2807626203,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nWPnb","user":{"login":"Dowsley","id":22419861,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDE5ODYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22419861?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley","html_url":"https://github.com/Dowsley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T22:01:20Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T22:05:26Z","body":"Still developing this. Managed to use `UNUserNotificationCenter` for modern systems + added support for callback. Before I commit need to address one concern about `p_duration`:\r\n\r\nI believe MacOS only supports scheduling notifications, but not setting their duration. At least I couldn't find anything like this via `UNUserNotificationCenter`. If confirmed this is not supported, we will need to document that `p_duration` will not be taken into account for MacOS platform. I also propose we throw a warning if caller passes non-default argument:\r\n\r\n```\r\n if (p_duration > DEFAULT_VAL) {\r\n     WARN_PRINT(\"Custom notification duration is not supported on macOS. System defaults will be used.\");\r\n }\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd regarding scheduling, I'm thinking, should we also consider adding a new parameter to the signature of `OS::send_notification` to support scheduling? Wondering what would be the optimal type of input for this argument to be easily used in any platform.\r\n\r\ncc @bruvzg @Calinou","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2807626203/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2808811208","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104980#issuecomment-2808811208","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104980","id":2808811208,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6naw7I","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-16T08:31:16Z","updated_at":"2025-04-16T08:31:16Z","body":"> I believe MacOS only supports scheduling notifications, but not setting their duration\r\n\r\nI do not think there's `duration` is directly supported, but it should be possible to periodically check `UNNotification.date` of delivered notification (`getDeliveredNotificationsWithCompletionHandler`) and delete them with `removeDeliveredNotificationsWithIdentifiers:`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2808811208/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816964071","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104980#issuecomment-2816964071","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104980","id":2816964071,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n53Xn","user":{"login":"Dowsley","id":22419861,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDE5ODYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22419861?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley","html_url":"https://github.com/Dowsley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T02:59:03Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T02:59:03Z","body":"> > I believe MacOS only supports scheduling notifications, but not setting their duration\r\n> \r\n> I do not think there's `duration` is directly supported, but it should be possible to periodically check `UNNotification.date` of delivered notification (`getDeliveredNotificationsWithCompletionHandler`) and delete them with `removeDeliveredNotificationsWithIdentifiers:`.\r\n\r\nI see. This seems somewhat hacky, and in such case, it might be worth leaving `duration` as unsupported for MacOS in this initial iteration. After all, the intended use of Banners is that their duration are automatically managed by the system and accessibility settings.\r\n\r\nI think scheduling is a must however (even if it wasn't on the original proposal). So I added it.\r\n\r\nAlso added aforementioned changes.\r\n\r\nUpdated description to reflect current state.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816964071/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816990440","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104980#issuecomment-2816990440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104980","id":2816990440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n59zo","user":{"login":"Dowsley","id":22419861,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDE5ODYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22419861?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley","html_url":"https://github.com/Dowsley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T04:43:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T04:43:09Z","body":"Ready for first round of reviews","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816990440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3751092291","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104980#issuecomment-3751092291","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104980","id":3751092291,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7flSBD","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-14T18:51:14Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T18:51:17Z","body":"> - Uses UNUserNotificationCenter on macOS 10.14+ and falls back to NSUserNotification on older versions\r\n\r\nGodot requires macOS 10.13 when using Compatibility (10.15 when using Forward+/Mobile), so the only version where the fallback code is useful is 10.13. It may not be worth the added maintenance cost to keep it, especially since there's no easy way to test this code on a modern system without a VM running an old version. I'll let @bruvzg weigh in on this.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3751092291/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]